    "text": "wcbi.com\nwebsite\nColumbus\nCalm until our next front\nBy Ashleigh Bryant,\n5 hours agoCOLUMBUS, Mississippi (WCBI) – Calm and clear for a little longer. A change comes over the weekend, bringing the chance for showers and storms. WEDNESDAY NIGHT: More of the same. Conditions over the past few nights are how they are going to be again. Mostly clear sky, with lows in the middle 50s.\nRelated Topics\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nGreg Wilson, CFA\n·\nuser · 19.7K followers\n8 Foods You Can Eat A Lot Of Without Gaining Weight, According to a Dietitian\nKim Yawitz, RD, is a registered dietitian and gym owner in St. Louis, Mo. In addition to coaching fitness and nutrition clients one-on-one and in small groups, Kim also shares her expertise with national media outlets. She enjoys cooking, reading, and spending time with her family.\nSt. Louis, MO ·28d\nEdmond Thorne\n·\nuser · 21.4K followers",
